{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41460","headline":"蔷薇二首 一 · 李建勳","name":"蔷薇二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"万蘂争开照槛光，诗家何物可相方。\n锦江风撼云霞碎，仙子衣飘黼黻香。\n裛露早英浓压架，背人狂蔓暗穿墙。\n彩牋蛮榼旬休日，欲召亲宾看一场。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李建勳","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41460.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41460","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}